police start searching for a motive  behind a deadly shooting rampage in  Louisiana law enforcement say 21 year  old Dakota Theriot killed five people  Saturday including his parents and a 20  year old woman believed to be his  girlfriend they say he then drove more  than 1,100 miles to Virginia where he  was arrested  Harold Barnett is in Warsaw Virginia  outside the jail where tario is being  held  Erol good morning good morning tario is  here at the Northern Neck Regional Jail  being held on no bond now he faces an  extradition hearing set for Friday that  would have him sent back to Louisiana  where he faces five counts of murder for  allegedly killing his own parents a  young woman and her family as well  there's infinite I never would have  thought it would mean my children Rhonda  champagnes world was ripped apart over  the weekend police say 21 year old  Dakota tario shot and killed two of her  children 20-year old summer earnest and  17 year-old Tanner earnest  along with their father 43 year old bill  earnest junior police say tario was  living with the Earnest family for the  last few weeks inside this mobile home  in Livingston Parish investigators say  after shooting the earnest family tario  then went to his family's mobile home  nearby where he opened fire on his  parents Keith and Elisabeth tario both  died but not before the father gave  police a vital clue we was able to get a  dying declaration from him only enough  information to let us know that it was  his son that committed this act  police say tario then drove to Richmond  County Virginia where his grandmother  lives but she was gone having already  checked into a hotel after hearing about  the shootings  she asked Richmond Sheriff's to check on  her home and officers were there when  tario pulled up had a pistol in his hand  he had it out of the window officers  engaged him tario dropped the gun and  was taken into custody  relatives of the earnest family are glad  he was arrested but say it doesn't fill  the giant void he left them  my niece and my nephew it'll never be  happy it'll never be the same and your  heart just goes out to everyone impacted  by this interestingly enough the sheriff  Stan Louisiana said that there were no  red flags in regards to tario before  this shooting authorities also say he  was asked to leave the earnest home and  told not to come back for the earnest  family the next step will be  particularly painful as they planned  funerals for not just one but four three  beloved family members unimaginable  Errol thank you
 

